+      300 short calls a fifth slower than at 16 (run 20261113-143508). So a KV cache
+      that is spoken for does not show as waiting: it shows in kv, and in the queue
+      once the active set is full.
+    - kv: blocks used over blocks there are, summed over the ranks. Blocks kept for
+      reuse are not counted as used: an idle engine reads 0.
